        "exit reason threshold must reconcile with pnl_pct unless the fill-price breach is explicitly explained",
        "exit reason alignment evidence must include checked_count, matched_count, and mismatch_count",
        "exit reason alignment evidence must echo fill_ledger_hash",
        "exit reason alignment evidence must include checked_symbols covering the handoff sample_symbols",
        "exit reason alignment evidence checked_count must be positive, matched_count must cover all checked trades, and mismatch_count must be zero",
        "exit reason alignment checked_count must match return reconciliation checked_count",
        "exit reason alignment checked_count must match the handoff trade_count",
        "unit currency audit status is pass or blocker before promotion",
        "unit/currency evidence must include currency, quote_unit, and split-adjustment confirmation",
        "unit/currency evidence must match the contract unit_currency_policy",
